  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;denote the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. If the domain of the real valued function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is:"
  },
