  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>For domain,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Case <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>:</mo></math> When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Case <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi><mo>:</mo></math> When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>So, from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p>Domain of function is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
